{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click, place, and upgrade your way to the ultimate goal: filling the Main Loading Bar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Click &amp; Place</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop smaller loading bars onto the board. Each one helps fill the big bar\u2014while making ridiculous, silly noises that keep the chaos lively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0871173ded3fb6d3b32b64b91d642ac7.poster.avif?t=1761472206\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0871173ded3fb6d3b32b64b91d642ac7.webm?t=1761472206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0871173ded3fb6d3b32b64b91d642ac7.mp4?t=1761472206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade &amp; Optimize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to buy upgrades, unlock new bar types, and discover smarter ways to maximize your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0850161789c4de2acea7fe9c730066d7.poster.avif?t=1761472206\" width=586 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0850161789c4de2acea7fe9c730066d7.webm?t=1761472206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0850161789c4de2acea7fe9c730066d7.mp4?t=1761472206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you play, the faster things escalate. Can you create the perfect setup to watch the screen flood with loading madness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Big Question</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you finally see the bar reach 100%?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/a754ed8802225474e9c52d4c6ed5d89c.apng?t=1761472206\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/a754ed8802225474e9c52d4c6ed5d89c.poster.avif?t=1761472206\" class=\"bb_img\" width=764 height=148 /></picture></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"10%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699690/d016fe7f8d5e3c33c488adbaa362b9d2d70529c2.jpg"},{"name":"20%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699690/4788713226894a03cb6279b8e46955826467b9a4.jpg"},{"name":"30%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699690/1ba04f3c902ef1fd613283aaf8e4f1df1d8f77df.jpg"},{"name":"40%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699690/04455482f752dcba85167362db3ed7f4f2f4059a.jpg"},{"name":"50%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699690/319a971736bec3bcd73b119fc1c601179d53327c.jpg"},{"name":"60%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699690/50916be0530893b47b8ed72f62d82dccb40e6159.jpg"},{"name":"70%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699690/c3e46ff60ba2c036a2de66c6200117faceef11b5.jpg"},{"name":"80%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699690/727fbe7cda4f9abe965820f0d3a65e6492d4fea6.jpg"},{"name":"90%","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3699690/ef075c2c91124b41235e104c69fc614f71740c6